                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "# Loaded Skill: lore-project-index (skill)\n\nKai's specific builds and their surfaces, nine entries across the Eco lines, the portfolio, attested bundles and the SaaS wedge ranking. Each body is a file in references/. Triggers - attested bundles, wedge 1, housecast attestation, Annex IV, test-result predicate, in-toto, evidence pack, raise trigger, Legalithm, should I compete, what is Kai building next, is this project dead, SB 813, AB 1405, California AI audit, IVO, AI auditor registry, /builds route, splat viewer, WebGL fallback, poster frame, mobile data gate, gallery design, sidecar, splat, gaussian splatting, Eco build capture, photogrammetry, Postshot, COLMAP, hero build, camera rings, why splat a game, prior art, RenderDoc, asset ripping, novel view synthesis, is this novel, voxel to mesh, housecast-attest, attest, attestation layer, what is the name, is the name taken, housecast verify, attested bundle, predicate profile, what is Kai working on, portfolio, current projects, is this project active, flagship, headline, umbra, mcp-beaver, housecast, acompose, Ward, Gauntlet, LUCA, Coily, repo-recall, SaaS ideas, wedges, twelve ideas, what should Kai build, new category, business idea, is this idea dead, reopen condition, ceiling test, portfolio strategy, Sirens Echo, Sirens Deep, which variant, demo agent, community bot, agent personality, conference demo, identity eval, agent self-recognition, agent-to-agent recognition, trajectory scoring, model sweep, failover, launch gate.\n\n## Content\n\n# project index\n\n9 entries. Each one is a file under `references/`, read the one you need\nrather than the whole directory.\n\n* [`attested-bundles.md`](references/attested-bundles.md) - The attested\n  housecast bundles wedge, PARKED 2026-09-08 on one unopened question, held\n  through the California AI audit laws of 2026-09-09, with the plan it was\n  parked from, the four research corrections, and the Legalithm competitive\n  read.\n* [`eco-builds-web-surface.md`](references/eco-builds-web-surface.md) - The\n  /builds route on eco-app where Eco splats are shown, and the five design\n  decisions that keep it from being a broken page.\n* [`eco-splat-pipeline.md`](references/eco-splat-pipeline.md) - Turning Eco\n  builds into Gaussian splats - capture rules, solve and train tooling, and the\n  two numbers that gate everything downstream.\n* [`game-world-splat-prior-art.md`](references/game-world-splat-prior-art.md) -\n  Why capturing a game world as a Gaussian splat is rarer than it should be,\n  and the four reasons Eco is a genuine exception.\n* [`housecast-attest.md`](references/housecast-attest.md) - housecast-attest,\n  the provisional name for the attestation layer binding a graded run to the\n  bundle digest it graded. What it is, the registry checks, the unsettled\n  distribution question, and where it sits between housecast and the assurance\n  thesis.\n* [`portfolio.md`](references/portfolio.md) - The current portfolio lanes, the\n  four committed headlines, the Forgejo source-of-truth rule, and the archived-\n  name guardrail against reviving dead projects.\n* [`saas-wedges.md`](references/saas-wedges.md) - The twelve SaaS wedges from\n  the 2026-09-02 strategy session, the four Kai endorsed, the three closed with\n  their reopen conditions, and the envelope corrections that shaped the\n  ranking.\n* [`sirens-configurations.md`](references/sirens-configurations.md) - Echo and\n  Deep are two configurations on one harness, which audience gets which, and\n  why neutrality is a liability in a tech-industry room.\n* [`sirens-deep-identity-eval.md`](references/sirens-deep-identity-eval.md) -\n  The identity and relationship evaluation gating the Sirens Deep demo - three\n  configurations not six, scoring end states not trajectories, and a\n  deliberately trimmed sweep.\n\n## Supporting Files\n\nSkill directory: /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-old-1/.agents/skills/lore-project-index\n\nRelative paths in this skill resolve from the skill directory. The shell tool runs in the session working directory, so use the resolved path below or `cd` into the skill directory before running supporting scripts.\n\n- references/eco-splat-pipeline.md → /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-old-1/.agents/skills/lore-project-index/references/eco-splat-pipeline.md (load_skill(name: \"lore-project-index/references/eco-splat-pipeline.md\"))\n- references/portfolio.md → /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-old-1/.agents/skills/lore-project-index/references/portfolio.md (load_skill(name: \"lore-project-index/references/portfolio.md\"))\n- references/sirens-configurations.md → /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-old-1/.agents/skills/lore-project-index/references/sirens-configurations.md (load_skill(name: \"lore-project-index/references/sirens-configurations.md\"))\n- references/game-world-splat-prior-art.md → /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-old-1/.agents/skills/lore-project-index/references/game-world-splat-prior-art.md (load_skill(name: \"lore-project-index/references/game-world-splat-prior-art.md\"))\n- references/saas-wedges.md → /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-old-1/.agents/skills/lore-project-index/references/saas-wedges.md (load_skill(name: \"lore-project-index/references/saas-wedges.md\"))\n- references/housecast-attest.md → /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-old-1/.agents/skills/lore-project-index/references/housecast-attest.md (load_skill(name: \"lore-project-index/references/housecast-attest.md\"))\n- references/sirens-deep-identity-eval.md → /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-old-1/.agents/skills/lore-project-index/references/sirens-deep-identity-eval.md (load_skill(name: \"lore-project-index/references/sirens-deep-identity-eval.md\"))\n- references/eco-builds-web-surface.md → /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-old-1/.agents/skills/lore-project-index/references/eco-builds-web-surface.md (load_skill(name: \"lore-project-index/references/eco-builds-web-surface.md\"))\n- references/attested-bundles.md → /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-old-1/.agents/skills/lore-project-index/references/attested-bundles.md (load_skill(name: \"lore-project-index/references/attested-bundles.md\"))\n"
