                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "# Loaded Skill: lore-stack-index (skill)\n\nKai's stack knowledge as ten entries, each body in references/. Agent-system layer ownership, browser-automation guardrails, why cross-machine session aggregation does not exist, the Forgejo self-hosting verdict, dedicated-server game ranking, git pull signature verification, brew services on macOS, the k3s multi-node postmortem, observability topology, and engineering principles that held across projects. Triggers - umbra, cli-guard, mcp-beaver, housecast, AOSguard, agent-compose, what owns what, agent architecture, permissions boundary, Claude in Chrome, browser MCP, LastPass, credentials in browser, session aggregation, watcher, cross-machine, Syncthing, session resumption, forgejo, self-host git, Gitea, Codeberg, backup drill, host a game server, dedicated server, which game to host, Factorio, Vintage Story, Valheim, git pull, verify signatures, unsigned commit, supply chain, merge.verifySignatures, brew services, launchd, daemon on mac, PATH in service, k3s agent, multi-node, WSL2, kubelet unreachable, br_netfilter, homelab cluster, observability, OTel, SigNoz, VictoriaMetrics, Grafana, Honeycomb, cardinality, MCP registry, framework choice, cache, Redis, retry, backoff, base image, deployment shape.\n\n## Content\n\n# stack index\n\nTen stack entries. Each one is a file under `references/`, read the one you\nneed rather than the whole directory.\n\n* [`agent-systems.md`](references/agent-systems.md) - layer-by-layer ownership\n  of the agent systems, the four-layer core after Ward was archived, and the\n  developer-versus-operator dichotomy under it.\n* [`browser-automation-guardrails.md`](references/browser-automation-guardrails.md) -\n  sharp edges from browser-automation MCPs, and the layered guardrails that\n  contain them.\n* [`cross-machine-session-aggregation.md`](references/cross-machine-session-aggregation.md) -\n  it does not exist. The watcher-to-sink pipeline was designed and never rolled\n  out, so sessions stay per-host.\n* [`forgejo-evaluation.md`](references/forgejo-evaluation.md) - the 2026\n  self-hosting evaluation, verdict green, its two watch-items, and the minimal\n  CI shape for validation-only repos.\n* [`games-homelab.md`](references/games-homelab.md) - dedicated-server games\n  ranked twice, by taste and by community accretion, plus the standing vetoes.\n* [`git-pull-verification.md`](references/git-pull-verification.md) - pull only\n  commits that are GPG-signed and authored by the expected author, and why both\n  checks are needed.\n* [`homebrew-services.md`](references/homebrew-services.md) - daemons on macOS\n  through brew services, and why zshrc exports are invisible to them.\n* [`k3s-multinode-postmortem.md`](references/k3s-multinode-postmortem.md) - why\n  the 2025 multi-node attempt failed, and the pre-flight that has to pass before\n  trying again.\n* [`o11y.md`](references/o11y.md) - observability topology, signal ownership,\n  the Honeycomb cardinality tradeoff, and the MCP-fleet governance pattern.\n* [`tech-principles.md`](references/tech-principles.md) - small engineering\n  rules that have held across more than one project.\n\n## Supporting Files\n\nSkill directory: /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-old-1/.agents/skills/lore-stack-index\n\nRelative paths in this skill resolve from the skill directory. The shell tool runs in the session working directory, so use the resolved path below or `cd` into the skill directory before running supporting scripts.\n\n- references/tech-principles.md → /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-old-1/.agents/skills/lore-stack-index/references/tech-principles.md (load_skill(name: \"lore-stack-index/references/tech-principles.md\"))\n- references/browser-automation-guardrails.md → /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-old-1/.agents/skills/lore-stack-index/references/browser-automation-guardrails.md (load_skill(name: \"lore-stack-index/references/browser-automation-guardrails.md\"))\n- references/git-pull-verification.md → /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-old-1/.agents/skills/lore-stack-index/references/git-pull-verification.md (load_skill(name: \"lore-stack-index/references/git-pull-verification.md\"))\n- references/cross-machine-session-aggregation.md → /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-old-1/.agents/skills/lore-stack-index/references/cross-machine-session-aggregation.md (load_skill(name: \"lore-stack-index/references/cross-machine-session-aggregation.md\"))\n- references/k3s-multinode-postmortem.md → /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-old-1/.agents/skills/lore-stack-index/references/k3s-multinode-postmortem.md (load_skill(name: \"lore-stack-index/references/k3s-multinode-postmortem.md\"))\n- references/o11y.md → /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-old-1/.agents/skills/lore-stack-index/references/o11y.md (load_skill(name: \"lore-stack-index/references/o11y.md\"))\n- references/forgejo-evaluation.md → /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-old-1/.agents/skills/lore-stack-index/references/forgejo-evaluation.md (load_skill(name: \"lore-stack-index/references/forgejo-evaluation.md\"))\n- references/agent-systems.md → /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-old-1/.agents/skills/lore-stack-index/references/agent-systems.md (load_skill(name: \"lore-stack-index/references/agent-systems.md\"))\n- references/homebrew-services.md → /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-old-1/.agents/skills/lore-stack-index/references/homebrew-services.md (load_skill(name: \"lore-stack-index/references/homebrew-services.md\"))\n- references/games-homelab.md → /private/var/folders/gt/p630435j2y3dmk7f_twxqqr40000gp/T/aos/native/zq56/evalrun/rh-old-1/.agents/skills/lore-stack-index/references/games-homelab.md (load_skill(name: \"lore-stack-index/references/games-homelab.md\"))\n"
