                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "DevTools Marketing Agency Flat Fee Pricing Guide 2026\nMonthly Developer Retainer Packages: Benefits and Pricing\nMonthly Retainer Pricing Guide: Structure &amp; Fees (2026)\nDevTools Startup Marketing Agency: What Founders Should Look for\nHow much would you charge for a monthly Retainer - Reddit\nThe Devtools Marketing Agency Playbook: How to Pick, Price, and Run…\nSoftware Development Retainer Agreements: Pricing &amp; Benefits | PricingLink\nDevTech Marketing Agency Pricing Guide 2026 - saashero.net\nDevTools Startup Credits: 43 Programs Compared\nFreelance developer retainer: how to structure, price, and track ...\n===SNIPPETS===\nresult__snippet\" href=\"https://www.saashero.net/strategy/devtools-marketing-agency-flat-fee/\">In 2026, DevTools marketing retainers start around $1,250 per month and scale to $7,000 per month for multi-channel, full-funnel support. Success should be measured by revenue-focused metrics such as Net New ARR, SQL-to-close rate, and CAC payback, not impressions or clicks.\nresult__snippet\" href=\"https://leanware.co/insights/monthly-developer-retainer-packages\">Discover how monthly developer retainer packages work, what they include, pricing models, and when they outperform fixed-price projects.\nresult__snippet\" href=\"https://freelancepricing.com/guides/monthly-retainer-pricing-guide\">Guide to structuring monthly retainers with clear scope, pricing adjustments, usage limits, overage terms, and sustainable economics.\nresult__snippet\" href=\"https://www.stackmatix.com/blog/devtools-startup-marketing-agency\">What a devtools startup marketing agency actually does The services that matter for a developer-first company are more technical and content-led than a traditional retainer.\nresult__snippet\" href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/sysadmin/comments/17c09qe/how_much_would_you_charge_for_a_monthly_retainer/\">If you do a fixed retainer, make sure you have an agreement on the scope of work that will cover. It&#x27;s dangerous to do fixed price contracts with unlimited hours. For continuing support clients that need a stable monthly budget, I find that offering a discounted prepaid block of hours each month generally works better.\nresult__snippet\" href=\"https://marketerhire.com/blog/devtools-marketing-agency\">A &quot;growth agency&quot; quoting you $6K/month is running juniors on a template. That worked for demand-gen SaaS in 2018; it does not work for devtools now. Beyond the retainer, budget separately for paid channel spend ($5K-$30K/month, non-LinkedIn) and conference sponsorships ($10K-$50K per event, half the marketing calendar). Total 12-month budget for a Series A-B devtool with a real go-to ...\nresult__snippet\" href=\"https://www.hourtab.com/blog/freelance-developer-retainer\">FAQ How many hours per month should a freelance developer retainer include? The most common range is 15-40 hours per month, depending on engagement type. Maintenance and support retainers typically run 10-15 hours; active development retainers run 20-30 hours; technical lead or near-full-time retainers run 30-40 hours.\nresult__snippet\" href=\"https://www.saashero.net/content/devtech-marketing-agency-pricing-2026/\">SaaSHero offers transparent flat monthly retainers starting at $1,250 with month-to-month terms, and you can schedule a discovery call to get pricing tailored to your DevTech marketing needs. Average DevTech Marketing Agency Costs in 2026 Monthly retainer costs vary significantly by service type, channel count, and client stage.\nresult__snippet\" href=\"https://creditforstartups.com/devtools-startup-credits\">Every credit program a devtools startup can claim, in one list. AWS, Google Cloud, GitHub, and Neon, plus 40 more. Free and independent.\nresult__snippet\" href=\"https://earnifyhub.com/blog/freelancing/freelance-retainer-contracts-2026\">Complete guide to freelance retainer contracts in 2026. What services work as retainers, how to scope and price them, what to include in the agreement, the retainer conversation script, and how to build a $5K/month retainer stack.",
                  "annotations": {
                    "priority": 0.0
                  }
                }
              ],
              "structuredContent": {
                "stdout": "DevTools Marketing Agency Flat Fee Pricing Guide 2026\nMonthly Developer Retainer Packages: Benefits and Pricing\nMonthly Retainer Pricing Guide: Structure &amp; Fees (2026)\nDevTools Startup Marketing Agency: What Founders Should Look for\nHow much would you charge for a monthly Retainer - Reddit\nThe Devtools Marketing Agency Playbook: How to Pick, Price, and Run…\nSoftware Development Retainer Agreements: Pricing &amp; Benefits | PricingLink\nDevTech Marketing Agency Pricing Guide 2026 - saashero.net\nDevTools Startup Credits: 43 Programs Compared\nFreelance developer retainer: how to structure, price, and track ...\n===SNIPPETS===\nresult__snippet\" href=\"https://www.saashero.net/strategy/devtools-marketing-agency-flat-fee/\">In 2026, DevTools marketing retainers start around $1,250 per month and scale to $7,000 per month for multi-channel, full-funnel support. Success should be measured by revenue-focused metrics such as Net New ARR, SQL-to-close rate, and CAC payback, not impressions or clicks.\nresult__snippet\" href=\"https://leanware.co/insights/monthly-developer-retainer-packages\">Discover how monthly developer retainer packages work, what they include, pricing models, and when they outperform fixed-price projects.\nresult__snippet\" href=\"https://freelancepricing.com/guides/monthly-retainer-pricing-guide\">Guide to structuring monthly retainers with clear scope, pricing adjustments, usage limits, overage terms, and sustainable economics.\nresult__snippet\" href=\"https://www.stackmatix.com/blog/devtools-startup-marketing-agency\">What a devtools startup marketing agency actually does The services that matter for a developer-first company are more technical and content-led than a traditional retainer.\nresult__snippet\" href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/sysadmin/comments/17c09qe/how_much_would_you_charge_for_a_monthly_retainer/\">If you do a fixed retainer, make sure you have an agreement on the scope of work that will cover. It&#x27;s dangerous to do fixed price contracts with unlimited hours. For continuing support clients that need a stable monthly budget, I find that offering a discounted prepaid block of hours each month generally works better.\nresult__snippet\" href=\"https://marketerhire.com/blog/devtools-marketing-agency\">A &quot;growth agency&quot; quoting you $6K/month is running juniors on a template. That worked for demand-gen SaaS in 2018; it does not work for devtools now. Beyond the retainer, budget separately for paid channel spend ($5K-$30K/month, non-LinkedIn) and conference sponsorships ($10K-$50K per event, half the marketing calendar). Total 12-month budget for a Series A-B devtool with a real go-to ...\nresult__snippet\" href=\"https://www.hourtab.com/blog/freelance-developer-retainer\">FAQ How many hours per month should a freelance developer retainer include? The most common range is 15-40 hours per month, depending on engagement type. Maintenance and support retainers typically run 10-15 hours; active development retainers run 20-30 hours; technical lead or near-full-time retainers run 30-40 hours.\nresult__snippet\" href=\"https://www.saashero.net/content/devtech-marketing-agency-pricing-2026/\">SaaSHero offers transparent flat monthly retainers starting at $1,250 with month-to-month terms, and you can schedule a discovery call to get pricing tailored to your DevTech marketing needs. Average DevTech Marketing Agency Costs in 2026 Monthly retainer costs vary significantly by service type, channel count, and client stage.\nresult__snippet\" href=\"https://creditforstartups.com/devtools-startup-credits\">Every credit program a devtools startup can claim, in one list. AWS, Google Cloud, GitHub, and Neon, plus 40 more. Free and independent.\nresult__snippet\" href=\"https://earnifyhub.com/blog/freelancing/freelance-retainer-contracts-2026\">Complete guide to freelance retainer contracts in 2026. What services work as retainers, how to scope and price them, what to in