              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "result__snippet\" href=\"https://www.salary.com/research/salary/position/senior-platform-engineer-salary\">How much does a Senior Platform Engineer make? The average annual salary of Senior Platform Engineer in the United States is $126,973 or $61 per hour, ranging from $106,533 to $141,980 and $51 to $68.\nresult__snippet\" href=\"https://statsforskills.com/usa/senior-platform-engineer\">Check average salary and pay rates for Senior Platform Engineer roles in United States. The median compensation is $151,346 as of July 2026, based on 236 active job listings.\nresult__snippet\" href=\"https://www.ziprecruiter.com/Salaries/Senior-Platform-Engineer-Salary\">A Senior Platform Engineer in your area makes on average $ 121,098 per year, or $5,459 (4.313 %) less than the national average annual salary of $126,557. Virginia ranks number 29 out of 50 states nationwide for Senior Platform Engineer salaries.\nresult__snippet\" href=\"https://www.kore1.com/platform-engineer-salary-guide-2026/\">Platform engineer salaries in 2026 run $128K to $205K base, $260K to $385K total at senior+. KORE1&#x27;s read on bands by level, city, stack, and company tier.\nresult__snippet\" href=\"https://statsforskills.com/usa/platform-engineer\">Check average salary and pay rates for Platform Engineer roles in United States. The median compensation is $110,849 as of July 2026, based on 153 active job listings.\nresult__snippet\" href=\"https://www.nextgencodingcompany.com/senior-engineer-salary-guide-2026\">That figure is what an hourly contract or staff-augmentation rate should be compared against, not the base. A $150/hr embedded senior engineer is about $260K annualized at full utilization, with no recruiting fee, no benefits load, no ramp risk, and the ability to stop.\nresult__snippet\" href=\"https://www.glassdoor.com/Salaries/senior-platform-engineer-salary-SRCH_KO0,24.htm\">How much does a Senior Platform Engineer make? The average salary for a Senior Platform Engineer is $250,146 per year or $120 per hour, with top earners making up to $394,321 (90th percentile). Typically, pay ranges from $199,249 (25th percentile) to $319,314 (75th percentile) annually. Salary estimates are based on 627 salaries submitted anonymously to Glassdoor by Senior Platform Engineer ...\nresult__snippet\" href=\"https://www.salary.com/research/salary/listing/platform-engineer-salary\">How much does a Platform Engineer make in the United States? As of August 01, 2026, the average salary for a Platform Engineer in the United States is $131,607 per year, which breaks down to an hourly rate of $63. However, a Platform Engineer&#x27;s salary can vary significantly. Here&#x27;s a look at the typical salary range: Top Earners (90th percentile): $147,949 Majority Range (25th-75th ...\nresult__snippet\" href=\"https://tryremotely.com/role/senior-platform-engineer/salaries\">Senior Platform Engineer salary data for 2026. Compare average salaries, salary ranges, and compensation trends for senior platform engineer positions.\nresult__snippet\" href=\"https://www.salaryexpert.com/salary/job/platform-engineer/united-states\">As of August, 26, 2026, the average platform engineer gross salary in United States is $116,293 or an equivalent hourly rate of $55.91. In addition, platform engineers earn an average bonus of $3,959. An entry level platform engineer with 1-3 years of experience earns an average salary of $82,955.",
                  "annotations": {
                    "priority": 0.0
                  }
                }
              ],
              "structuredContent": {
                "stdout": "result__snippet\" href=\"https://www.salary.com/research/salary/position/senior-platform-engineer-salary\">How much does a Senior Platform Engineer make? The average annual salary of Senior Platform Engineer in the United States is $126,973 or $61 per hour, ranging from $106,533 to $141,980 and $51 to $68.\nresult__snippet\" href=\"https://statsforskills.com/usa/senior-platform-engineer\">Check average salary and pay rates for Senior Platform Engineer roles in United States. The median compensation is $151,346 as of July 2026, based on 236 active job listings.\nresult__snippet\" href=\"https://www.ziprecruiter.com/Salaries/Senior-Platform-Engineer-Salary\">A Senior Platform Engineer in your area makes on average $ 121,098 per year, or $5,459 (4.313 %) less than the national average annual salary of $126,557. Virginia ranks number 29 out of 50 states nationwide for Senior Platform Engineer salaries.\nresult__snippet\" href=\"https://www.kore1.com/platform-engineer-salary-guide-2026/\">Platform engineer salaries in 2026 run $128K to $205K base, $260K to $385K total at senior+. KORE1&#x27;s read on bands by level, city, stack, and company tier.\nresult__snippet\" href=\"https://statsforskills.com/usa/platform-engineer\">Check average salary and pay rates for Platform Engineer roles in United States. The median compensation is $110,849 as of July 2026, based on 153 active job listings.\nresult__snippet\" href=\"https://www.nextgencodingcompany.com/senior-engineer-salary-guide-2026\">That figure is what an hourly contract or staff-augmentation rate should be compared against, not the base. A $150/hr embedded senior engineer is about $260K annualized at full utilization, with no recruiting fee, no benefits load, no ramp risk, and the ability to stop.\nresult__snippet\" href=\"https://www.glassdoor.com/Salaries/senior-platform-engineer-salary-SRCH_KO0,24.htm\">How much does a Senior Platform Engineer make? The average salary for a Senior Platform Engineer is $250,146 per year or $120 per hour, with top earners making up to $394,321 (90th percentile). Typically, pay ranges from $199,249 (25th percentile) to $319,314 (75th percentile) annually. Salary estimates are based on 627 salaries submitted anonymously to Glassdoor by Senior Platform Engineer ...\nresult__snippet\" href=\"https://www.salary.com/research/salary/listing/platform-engineer-salary\">How much does a Platform Engineer make in the United States? As of August 01, 2026, the average salary for a Platform Engineer in the United States is $131,607 per year, which breaks down to an hourly rate of $63. However, a Platform Engineer&#x27;s salary can vary significantly. Here&#x27;s a look at the typical salary range: Top Earners (90th percentile): $147,949 Majority Range (25th-75th ...\nresult__snippet\" href=\"https://tryremotely.com/role/senior-platform-engineer/salaries\">Senior Platform Engineer salary data for 2026. Compare average salaries, salary ranges, and compensation trends for senior platform engineer positions.\nresult__snippet\" href=\"https://www.salaryexpert.com/salary/job/platform-engineer/united-states\">As of August, 26, 2026, the average platform engineer gross salary in United States is $116,293 or an equivalent hourly rate of $55.91. In addition, platform engineers earn an average bonus of $3,959. An entry level platform engineer with 1-3 years of experience earns an average salary of $82,955.",
